---
// https://hugopos.eu/en/compare/, port 1:1 skriptem port-hugo.py (scrape 13. 10. 2026)
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import hugoAbUrl from '../../scripts/hugo-ab.js?url';
import '../../styles/sub.css';
import hugoI18nUrl from '../../scripts/hugo-i18n.js?url';
import hugoNavUrl from '../../scripts/hugo-nav.js?url';
---
<Base
  title={"POS comparison: Dotykačka, Storyous, KASA FIK, KiloMayo, SumUp"}
  lang={"en"}
  description={"A fair comparison of POS systems for cafés, bars and restaurants: Hugo, Dotykačka, Storyous, KASA FIK, KiloMayo and SumUp. Prices, card fees, hardware and terms in one place."}
  ogDescription={"Prices, card fees, hardware and terms of six POS systems in one place."}
  image={"/assets/og/og-en.png"}
  imageAlt={"POS comparison: Dotykačka, Storyous, KASA FIK, KiloMayo, SumUp | Hugo"}
  alternates={{ cs: '/srovnani/', en: '/en/compare/' }}
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script is:inline src={hugoAbUrl}></script>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Spline+Sans:wght@300..700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Spline+Sans:wght@300..700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"></noscript>
<script is:inline src={hugoI18nUrl} defer></script>
<script is:inline src={hugoNavUrl} defer></script>
</Fragment>
<header class="nav">
  <div class="container nav-inner">
    <a href="/en/" class="brand"><img src="/assets/hugo-icon.svg" alt="" /><span>Hugo</span></a>
    
    <button class="nav-burger" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navLinks" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="/en/#product">Product</a>
      <a href="/en/getting-started/">How to start</a>
      <a href="/en/compare/" class="is-on">Compare</a>
      <a href="/en/pricing/">Pricing</a>
      <a href="/en/#reference">Customers</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <div class="lang" id="langToggle"><a href="/srovnani/" hreflang="cs" lang="cs" data-lang-link>CZ</a><a href="/en/compare/" hreflang="en" lang="en" data-lang-link class="is-on" aria-current="true">EN</a></div>
      <a href="https://admin.hugopos.eu/login?start=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">Start free</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="phero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Hugo vs. the others</span>
    <h1>Six tills, one table. <span class="hl">Prices, features and terms.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Selected hospitality plans and features based on public information as of 1 October 2026. Packages differ; the lowest subscription alone does not determine total costs. Conditions, sources and methodology are listed below.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a href="/en/pricing/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">See Hugo pricing</a>
      <a href="#prechod" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">How switching works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="tabulka">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">At a glance</span>
      <h2>What you pay and what you get. <em>Side by side.</em></h2>
      <p class="comparison-date">Comparison as of 1 October 2026. Prices and terms may change.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table class="tbl">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col"></th>
            <th scope="col" class="is-hugo">Hugo</th>
            <th scope="col">Dotykačka</th>
            <th scope="col">Storyous</th>
            <th scope="col">KASA FIK</th>
            <th scope="col">KiloMayo</th>
            <th scope="col">SumUp</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Entry plan / month (software only)</th>
            <td class="is-hugo">190 Kč<small>one plan, everything included</small></td>
            <td>425–502 Kč<small>SNADNO, billed annually; cheaper with more card turnover via Dotypay</small></td>
            <td>ask the provider for a quote<small>no public price list found as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td>297 Kč<small>LITE, max. 60 menu items</small></td>
            <td>ask the provider for a quote<small>no public price list found as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td>0 Kč<small>basic POS app</small></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Plan with stock & table map</th>
            <td class="is-hugo">190 Kč<small>same plan</small></td>
            <td>858,50–1 012 Kč<small>NAPLNO, billed annually, by card turnover</small></td>
            <td>check with the provider<small>not stated in sources as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td>849 Kč<small>PREMIUM; 721,65 Kč billed annually</small></td>
            <td>check with the provider<small>not stated in sources as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td>1 199 Kč<small>POS Plus (table layout)</small></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Card fee</th>
            <td class="is-hugo">1,1 %<small>+ interchange & scheme fees at cost (MIF++)</small></td>
            <td>0,79–0,99 % + MIF++<small>Dotypay, by plan; min. 350 Kč/month below ~35k turnover</small></td>
            <td>ask the provider for a quote<small>no rate found in public sources as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td>1,49 % + MIF++<small>KASA PAY; individually from 0,69 % for premium clients</small></td>
            <td>no rate found in public sources as of 1 October 2026</td>
            <td>1,95 %<small>all-in; or 0,95 % with Platby Plus for 519 Kč/month</small></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Hardware</th>
            <td class="is-hugo">your phone 0 Kč<small>or Hugo terminal 4 900 Kč</small></td>
            <td>from 6 990 Kč<small>their Android devices</small></td>
            <td>check with the provider<small>not stated in sources as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td>from 3 499 Kč<small>their own devices</small></td>
            <td>your phone or tablet</td>
            <td>from 899 Kč<small>terminal; till 9 599 Kč</small></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Devices, staff, items</th>
            <td class="is-hugo">unlimited</td>
            <td>mobile waiters by plan</td>
            <td>check with the provider<small>not stated in sources as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td>items capped by plan<small>60 / 500 / 10 000</small></td>
            <td>check with the provider<small>not stated in sources as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td>by plan</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Commitment</th>
            <td class="is-hugo">no notice period, cancel any time</td>
            <td>monthly or annual subscription</td>
            <td>individual</td>
            <td>no commitment</td>
            <td>7-day trial</td>
            <td>no contract</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Public price in sources as of 1 October 2026</th>
            <td class="is-hugo yes">yes</td>
            <td class="yes">yes</td>
            <td class="no">not found<small>as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td class="yes">yes</td>
            <td class="no">not found<small>as of 1 October 2026</small></td>
            <td class="yes">yes</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="tbl-hint">Swipe the table sideways to see every till.</p>
    <p class="note">Source information as of 1 October 2026, prices excl. VAT. The table separates software, transaction fees and hardware; these are not identical packages or a ranking by total costs. <a href="/en/pricing/#srovnani">Model café: 100 000 Kč a month in card payments</a>. <a href="#metodika">Methodology, limitations and sources</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-alt" id="kdo">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">One by one</span>
      <h2>Where each one shines. <em>And where Hugo does it differently.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Dotykačka <span class="tag">market leader</span></h3>
        <ul class="pm">
          <li class="p">Huge install base, 24/7 support</li>
          <li class="p">Lots of integrations (accounting, e-shops)</li>
          <li class="m">Stock only from the NAPLNO plan up</li>
          <li class="m">Plans, add-ons and licence pricing depend on card turnover</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="vs-hugo">Hugo: <b>one plan with stock included</b>, on the phone you already own.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Storyous <span class="tag">now Teya</span></h3>
        <ul class="pm">
          <li class="p">Built for restaurants, delivery-platform integrations</li>
          <li class="p">Attendance and QR table ordering</li>
          <li class="m">No public price list found as of 1 October 2026; ask the provider for a quote</li>
          <li class="m">No public card rate found as of 1 October 2026</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="vs-hugo">Hugo: <b>every price on one page</b>, the same for everyone.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>KASA FIK <span class="tag">own hardware</span></h3>
        <ul class="pm">
          <li class="p">Low entry price, no commitment</li>
          <li class="p">Range of its own devices</li>
          <li class="m">Menu items capped by plan (60 / 500 / 10 000)</li>
          <li class="m">Stock and table map in PREMIUM only</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="vs-hugo">Hugo: <b>unlimited items</b>, stock and tables for 190 Kč.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>KiloMayo <span class="tag">young challenger</span></h3>
        <ul class="pm">
          <li class="p">Modern app on your own phone or tablet</li>
          <li class="p">Analytics and loyalty in one place</li>
          <li class="m">No public price list found as of 1 October 2026; ask the provider for a quote</li>
          <li class="m">Shorter track record on the market</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="vs-hugo">Hugo: <b>same modern approach</b>, plus a published price and our own terminal.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>SumUp <span class="tag">terminal first</span></h3>
        <ul class="pm">
          <li class="p">Transparent pricing, no contract</li>
          <li class="p">Cheap terminals, free basic app</li>
          <li class="m">1,95 % per card, or a monthly fee for a lower rate</li>
          <li class="m">Table layout only in POS Plus for 1 199 Kč a month</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="vs-hugo">Hugo: <b>hospitality features in one plan</b>; SumUp offers a basic app or POS Plus depending on your needs.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card dark">
        <h3>Hugo</h3>
        <ul class="pm">
          <li class="p">190 Kč a month excl. VAT, everything included</li>
          <li class="p">Stock, shifts, table orders, kitchen display</li>
          <li class="p">Live in 5 minutes, menu from a photo</li>
          <li class="p">No notice period, 14 days free, money back</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="vs-hugo">Take cards <b>on Android</b> or on the Hugo terminal.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="vybirani">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Choosing a till</span>
      <h2>Six questions to ask any till. <em>Ours included.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">Hospitality people keep asking the same things. Here’s the list, with Hugo’s honest answer next to each.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="checks">
      <li><span class="ck">1</span><span><b>Does the amount reach the card terminal on its own?</b><span class="t">Hugo: yes. Retyping amounts is how mistakes happen.</span></span></li>
      <li><span class="ck">2</span><span><b>Can staff take orders at the table?</b><span class="t">Hugo: yes, from any phone, straight to the kitchen display.</span></span></li>
      <li><span class="ck">3</span><span><b>Is stock included, or an add-on?</b><span class="t">Hugo: included, with recipes and stock-takes.</span></span></li>
      <li><span class="ck">4</span><span><b>Shifts and staff?</b><span class="t">Hugo: included, unlimited staff.</span></span></li>
      <li><span class="ck">5</span><span><b>Reports I can actually read?</b><span class="t">Hugo: live sales, plus an export for your accountant.</span></span></li>
      <li><span class="ck">6</span><span><b>What does it cost in total – hardware, licence, add-ons?</b><span class="t">Hugo: 190 Kč a month for software when taking cards with us, plus card fees and any hardware. <a href="/en/pricing/">Full pricing</a>.</span></span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-alt" id="prechod">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <div>
        <h2>Switching from another till? <em>We do the heavy lifting.</em></h2>
        <p>We import your menu, Hugo runs next to your current till, and you flip the switch when you’re ready. Migration is free.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="mailto:hugo@piano.cz" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Book a free migration</a>
        <a href="https://admin.hugopos.eu/login?start=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" style="color:#fff; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);">Try it free</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec comparison-methodology" id="metodika" aria-labelledby="methodology-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head"><h2 id="methodology-title">How we did the maths.</h2></div>
    <p class="comparison-intro">Our lawyer promised one short note. You can see how that went below. In plain English: every venue has different bills. So we show our assumptions, where the prices come from and what the totals leave out. Run the numbers for your own place – another provider might work out cheaper. Prices change, so we check them every month.</p>
    <p><b>Scope and sources.</b> The <a href="/en/compare/#tabulka">six-system table</a> compares selected monthly subscriptions and hospitality features using official public price lists and product pages as of 1 October 2026. Packages are not identical and the table does not cover the whole market. “Not found” means the information was not found in the sources used for this comparison; it does not mean the provider lacks the service or cannot offer a better price.</p>
    <p><b>A model, not a quote for every business.</b> The <a href="/en/pricing/#srovnani">model café</a> has one venue, 100 000 Kč monthly card turnover and 400 payments of 250 Kč. It includes software and estimated fees for standard consumer cards. Dotykačka and KASA FIK licences are monthly equivalents of annual billing; SumUp POS Plus and Payments Plus use monthly billing. This is not the cheapest possible combination of every offer. Totals exclude hardware, extra devices, individual discounts, add-ons, introductory offers and VAT. The annual view is twelve identical months, not a price forecast.</p>
    <p><b>Cards and MIF++.</b> Hugo charges 1,1 % with no fixed per-transaction surcharge, plus interchange and scheme fees passed through at cost. For Hugo, Dotypay and KASA PAY, the model estimates these two components together at 0,4 % of turnover; this is not a guaranteed rate. SumUp uses a blended rate; the model uses 0,95 % with Payments Plus at 519 Kč per month for eligible consumer cards. Other cards or online payments may carry different rates. Actual costs depend on turnover, card mix and contract terms.</p>
    <p><b>When might another option cost less?</b> If you do not need stock and a table map, SumUp’s basic app has a 0 Kč subscription and a 1,95 % card-present rate in the sources as of 1 October 2026. At low turnover it may cost less than a paid hospitality plan. Annual subscriptions, individual offers or hardware you already own may also change the result. The model therefore does not establish the lowest price for every customer.</p>
    <p><b>Checks and corrections.</b> We review public sources monthly. We change the comparison date only after verifying the compared information; this is not a live supplier price list. Check the provider’s current offer before deciding. Found a change, or represent one of the systems? Email <a href="mailto:hugo@piano.cz">hugo@piano.cz</a> with a source link. We will verify it and correct any inaccuracy.</p>
    <h3>Official sources for checking current offers</h3>
    <ul class="comparison-sources">
      <li><a href="https://dotykacka.cz/cenik/">Dotykačka / Dotypay</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.storyous.com/cs/faq">Storyous / Teya</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.kasafik.cz/web/cs/cenik/">KASA FIK</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://kilomayo.com/">KiloMayo</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.sumup.com/cs-cz/ceny/">SumUp</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="container foot-in">
    <div>&copy; 2026 Hugo &middot; <span>a Czech product by Piano</span> &middot; <a href="mailto:hugo@piano.cz">hugo@piano.cz</a></div>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="/en/">Home</a>
      <a href="/en/pricing/">Pricing</a>
      <a href="/vseobecne-obchodni-podminky/">Terms & conditions</a>
      <a href="https://piano.cz/gdpr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GDPR</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
</Base>
